# embedded seed pack must be stored byte-for-byte
#
# manifest.json records a SHA-256 per seeded file, and a hash is computed over
# bytes. If line-ending conversion is allowed, the same content checks out as
# CRLF on Windows and LF on Linux CI, the two hashes differ, and the pre-seed
# integrity check fails on CI for reasons unrelated to the code. -text disables
# conversion entirely: whatever bytes are stored are the bytes every platform gets.
agent/internal/seed/pack/** -text

# Keep text files LF in the repository to avoid cross-platform diff noise.
* text=auto eol=lf
